    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/online-learning-lms/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Learning LMS Theme is a responsive and modern solution created for educators, tutors, schools, universities, training institutes, coaching centers, and platforms focused on delivering structured e-learning content, making it suitable for education, online course platforms, and digital learning environments. It is designed for building an educational website with features that support course creation, management, and organization, allowing users to browse a course catalog, enroll in training programs, complete quizzes, submit assignments, and track progress through a student dashboard. Built with optimized and clean code, it ensures reliable performance and responsiveness across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. It supports integration with tools such as the LearnPress plugin for full LMS functionality, along with WooCommerce for handling course-related transactions, Contact Form 7 for inquiries, WPML for multilingual support, and Yoast SEO for improved search visibility. Additional features include drip content scheduling, multi-instructor capability, course prerequisites, structured lesson management, and discussion options to enhance the overall learning experience. It can also be adapted for creating an education blog to share learning resources, updates, and academic content in a well-organized and accessible format."
    },
